==Russian==

===Alternative forms===
* {{alter|ru|бѣда́||ru-PRO}}

===Etymology===
{{root|ru|ine-pro|*bʰeydʰ-}}
{{inh+|ru|sla-pro|*běda}}, from {{der|ru|ine-pro|*bʰeydʰ-}}, whence {{cog|en|bide}}, {{m|en|faith}} and {{m|en|fidelity}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|беда́}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-беда.ogg}}
* {{audio|ru|LL-Q7737 (rus)-Tatiana Kerbush-беда.wav|a=Saint Petersburg}}

===Noun===
{{ru-noun+|d|беда́|adj=бедо́вый|dim=бе́дка,беду́лька}}

# [[misfortune]], [[trouble]], [[disaster]], [[mischief]]

====Declension====
{{ru-noun-table|d|беда́}}

====Derived terms====
